    <id>hermiq</id>
    <name lang="en">Hermiq</name>
    <name lang="nl">Hermiq</name>
    <summary lang="en">Schedule autonomous AI agents in Nextcloud</summary>
    <summary lang="nl">Plan autonome AI-agents in Nextcloud</summary>
    <description lang="en"><![CDATA[Hermiq brings autonomous AI agents to Nextcloud. Define an agent, give it tools, and run it on a schedule — daily reports, inbox triage, monitoring, morning briefings — all inside your own Nextcloud, delivered to Nextcloud Talk. Agents, their memory and their self-improving skills are stored as OpenRegister objects, so every run is governed, auditable and multi-tenant.

**Requires:** [OpenRegister](https://apps.nextcloud.com/apps/openregister) 0.2.17-unstable.13 or higher (install/upgrade from the [Nextcloud App Store](https://apps.nextcloud.com/apps/openregister)) — Hermiq's agent engine (chat, scheduled runs, flow-triggered agent actions) calls OpenRegister's `ToolRegistryFacade` and dispatches on its `AgentRunRequestedEvent`, both of which only exist from that OpenRegister version onward.]]></description>
    <description lang="nl"><![CDATA[Hermiq brengt autonome AI-agents naar Nextcloud. Definieer een agent, geef deze tools, en laat hem volgens een schema draaien — dagelijkse rapportages, inbox-triage, monitoring, ochtendbriefings — allemaal binnen je eigen Nextcloud, afgeleverd in Nextcloud Talk. Agents, hun geheugen en hun zelflerende skills worden opgeslagen als OpenRegister-objecten, zodat elke run beheerd, controleerbaar en multi-tenant is.

**Vereist:** [OpenRegister](https://apps.nextcloud.com/apps/openregister) 0.2.17-unstable.13 of hoger (installeer/upgrade via de [Nextcloud App Store](https://apps.nextcloud.com/apps/openregister)) — Hermiq's agent-engine (chat, geplande runs, flow-getriggerde agent-acties) roept OpenRegister's `ToolRegistryFacade` aan en luistert naar diens `AgentRunRequestedEvent`, die beide pas vanaf die OpenRegister-versie bestaan.]]></description>
